# Trivy ignore rules (auto-detected in the scan root).
#
# DS-0002 — "Specify a non-root USER in the Dockerfile".
# The only Dockerfile here is .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile, which derives FROM
# gcr.io/oss-fuzz-base/base-builder and builds fuzz targets AS ROOT: the
# OSS-Fuzz toolchain writes to root-owned $SRC/$OUT/$WORK and build_fuzzers
# invokes it as root, so a non-root USER breaks the build. It is a transient
# CI builder, never a running service. (Path-scoping needs .trivyignore.yaml,
# which this trivy version does not auto-read; the repo has no other Dockerfile,
# so a bare ignore is equivalent here.)
AVD-DS-0002
DS-0002
